# gallery/*.gif are regenerated by executing the gallery notebook but are
# COMMITTED, not ignored: the notebook displays them via raw.githubusercontent
# URLs (GitHub's notebook renderer drops image/gif outputs), so an ignored
# GIF would 404 there. Re-executing refreshes them in place.
